  aciklama: "3. kat, daire 1, Kerem'in ailesi (par\xE7a birle\u015Ftirme). Kerem'in
    y\u0131rt\u0131k \xE7iziminin d\xF6rt par\xE7as\u0131: sahanl\u0131ktaki ayakkab\u0131l\u0131kta,
    antrede okul \xE7antas\u0131n\u0131n \xFCst\xFCnde, salonda kanepenin alt\u0131nda,
    Oda B'deki oyuncak sand\u0131\u011F\u0131nda. Oda B'nin anahtar\u0131 mutfak
    \xE7ekmecesinde. Birle\u015Fen resmin k\xF6\u015Felerinde 0 3 0 9: Oda A'n\u0131n
    \u015Fifresi; komodinin \xE7ekmecesinde kat\u0131n anahtar\u0131. Banyo ve kiler
    kapal\u0131. Oda oda d\xF6\u015Fendi (#83)."
